00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:42.157
Enter Daniel Scali.

00:02:42.157 --> 00:02:43.460
(slow drum music)

00:02:43.460 --> 00:02:47.160
Three hours in, and
he's keeping good form.

00:02:47.160 --> 00:02:48.200
Part of the thing

00:02:48.200 --> 00:02:51.470
of keeping a plank is having
really strong shoulders

00:02:51.470 --> 00:02:53.130
in addition to a strong core.

00:02:53.130 --> 00:02:55.350
And the core is not just
your abdominal muscle.

00:02:55.350 --> 00:02:56.350
It's your obliques.

00:02:56.350 --> 00:03:00.110
It's your posterior
erector spinae muscles.

00:03:00.110 --> 00:03:02.290
Five hours, six hours.

00:03:02.290 --> 00:03:03.458
- The seven hour mark came.

00:03:03.458 --> 00:03:05.490
My body started to turn
on me a little bit.

00:03:05.490 --> 00:03:07.230
- I can't even do anything

00:03:07.230 --> 00:03:09.680
for seven hours straight
without taking a break,

00:03:09.680 --> 00:03:11.200
and my guy's planking.

00:03:11.200 --> 00:03:13.030
- I started to actually vomit on myself.

00:03:13.030 --> 00:03:14.999
