00:03:14.999 --> 00:03:17.190
Look at this guy! He didn't
even need a catheter!

00:03:17.190 --> 00:03:18.860
He vomited while doing it!

00:03:18.860 --> 00:03:20.017
- Three, two, one.

00:03:23.810 --> 00:03:26.260
