day in the life vlog.

00:11:29.920 --> 00:11:32.711
I literally go see a dermatologist
to get my eye injected.

00:11:32.711 --> 00:11:34.510
That's right. I know it
doesn't make a lot of sense,

00:11:34.510 --> 00:11:35.770
so click here to watch it.

00:11:35.770 --> 00:11:39.210
Cool day. Day in the life
of a doctor. Click here.

00:11:39.210 --> 00:11:40.610
As always, stay happy and healthy,

00:11:40.610 --> 00:11:42.203
